OL,3,AAI stocks climb after trillions wiped
OL,4,Afrom market values
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in artificial intelligence and
OL,7,Ftechnology firms have been climbing
OL,8,Ffollowing an enormous sell-off that
OL,9,Fwiped trillions of dollars off stock
OL,10,Fvalues.
OL,12,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq stock index
OL,13,Fopened higher following a market rout
OL,14,Fthat began in the US on Thursday before
OL,15,Fspilling over to Asian and European
OL,16,Fmarkets into Friday.
OL,18,FInvestors had been selling off tech
OL,19,Fshares in part due to concerns the
OL,20,FDemocrat victory in the midterm
OL,21,Felections would mean slower artificial
OL,22,Fintelligence development.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
