OL,3,ADozens of Democrats eyeing 2028
OL,4,Apresidential run, says former Obama
OL,5,Aaide
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than two dozen Democrats are
OL,8,Feyeing runs for the White House in
OL,9,F2028, following their party's success
OL,10,Fin the US midterm elections this week,
OL,11,Faccording to the man behind Barack
OL,12,FObama's successful re-election bid.
OL,14,FJim Messina, who led Obama's 2012
OL,15,Fcampaign, said that since Democrats saw
OL,16,Fmajor victories in congressional races
OL,17,Fas well as state elections, he's spoken
OL,18,Fto "over two dozen campaigns" that are
OL,19,Factively considering running in 2028
OL,20,Fand have begun the financing process
OL,21,Fand hiring staff.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
