OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ADozens of Democrats eyeing 2028
OL,4,Apresidential run, says former Obama
OL,5,Aaide
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I think you're going to start having
OL,8,FDemocrats announce exploratory
OL,9,Fcommittees next week or the next couple
OL,10,Fof weeks, probably after Thanksgiving",
OL,11,FMessina told the BBC's Americast
OL,12,Fpodcast.
OL,14,FHe said he already knows someone
OL,15,Frelocating to work on a governor's
OL,16,Fpresidential campaign.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
